OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F309A1786191514
OL,3,CArsene Wenger says Fifa's U-turn was
OL,4,C'absolutely necessary and beyond
OL,5,Cquestion'
OL,7,FFifa's chief of global football
OL,8,Fdevelopment, Arsene Wenger, said
OL,9,FGianni Infantino's decision to
OL,10,Fwithdraw from a plan to sell stakes in
OL,11,Fa World Cup company to private
OL,12,Finvestors was "absolutely necessary
OL,13,Fand beyond question".
OL,15,FFormer Arsenal manager Wenger issued a
OL,16,Fstatement on Tuesday, a week after
OL,17,FInfantino announced his proposal to
OL,18,Fcreate Fifa Forward Enterprise (FFE)
OL,19,Fand sell a 20 per cent stake in it to
OL,20,Fprivate equity.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G1/9
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,310,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30902
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F309A1786191514
OL,3,CArsene Wenger says Fifa's U-turn was
OL,4,C'absolutely necessary and beyond
OL,5,Cquestion'
OL,7,FThe plan was rejected by three
OL,8,Fcontinental confederations, with Uefa
OL,9,Fgoing further and threatening to
OL,10,Fboycott the World Cup and other Fifa
OL,11,Fcompetitions if it was not dropped.
OL,13,FInfantino's senior adviser Carlos
OL,14,FCordeiro also quit the organisation
OL,15,Flast week, saying: "I cannot stand by
OL,16,Fwhile Fifa considers selling a stake
OL,17,Fin the World Cup."
OL,19,FCordeiro also urged other members of
OL,20,FFifa to speak out against the plan.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G2/9
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,310,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30903
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F309A1786191514
OL,3,CArsene Wenger says Fifa's U-turn was
OL,4,C'absolutely necessary and beyond
OL,5,Cquestion'
OL,7,FWenger did not indicate any intention
OL,8,Fto quit himself, but made clear he was
OL,9,Fopposed to the FFE plan, saying he
OL,10,Fbelieved in Fifa serving the game with
OL,11,F"commitment, transparency, and
OL,12,Fintegrity".
OL,14,F"The recent events at Fifa deserve
OL,15,Fsome clarity from my side," the
OL,16,FFrenchman said in a statement.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G3/9
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,310,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30904
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F309A1786191514
OL,3,CArsene Wenger says Fifa's U-turn was
OL,4,C'absolutely necessary and beyond
OL,5,Cquestion'
OL,7,F"At Fifa, I am the Chief of Global
OL,8,FFootball Development. Together with my
OL,9,Fteam, I oversee the data analysis of
OL,10,Fthe game, the Fifa online training
OL,11,Fcentre, the development of youth
OL,12,Feducation through 60 academies across
OL,13,F60 countries where they are most
OL,14,Fneeded, and youth competitions around
OL,15,Fthe world.
OL,17,F"In addition, I am a technical adviser
OL,18,Fto IFAB. I was not involved in this
OL,19,Fstrategic plan and first became aware
OL,20,Fof the project through media reports.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G4/9
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,310,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30905
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F309A1786191514
OL,3,CArsene Wenger says Fifa's U-turn was
OL,4,C'absolutely necessary and beyond
OL,5,Cquestion'
OL,7,F"The decision to withdraw the project
OL,8,Fwas absolutely necessary and beyond
OL,9,Fquestion, because I firmly believe in
OL,10,Fan independent Fifa that serves our
OL,11,Fgame with commitment, transparency,
OL,12,Fand integrity."
OL,14,FWenger's statement comes as a number
OL,15,Fof European associations withdraw
OL,16,Ftheir support for Infantino.
OL,18,FThe Football Association of Wales
OL,19,F(FAW) issued a statement confirming it
OL,20,Fhad withdrawn its support.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G5/9
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
