CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F309A1786191514
OL,3,CArsene Wenger says Fifa's U-turn was
OL,4,C'absolutely necessary and beyond
OL,5,Cquestion'
OL,7,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,8,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,9,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,10,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,12,FThat followed Uefa issuing a statement
OL,13,Fon Saturday welcoming the withdrawal
OL,14,Fof the FFE plan but stating it had
OL,15,F"lost confidence" in Infantino.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G6/9
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,310,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30907
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F309A1786191514
OL,3,CArsene Wenger says Fifa's U-turn was
OL,4,C'absolutely necessary and beyond
OL,5,Cquestion'
OL,7,FAs he withdrew his plan on Saturday,
OL,8,FInfantino said: "Having listened
OL,9,Fcarefully to all the views, it has
OL,10,Fbecome clear that the project has
OL,11,Fcreated divisions of a nature that,
OL,12,Fregardless of the level of support,
OL,13,Fare no longer in the interest of the
OL,14,Fobjective set out in the first place."
OL,16,FHe added that the proposal "will not
OL,17,Fproceed".
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G7/9
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
