OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F309A1786191514
OL,3,CArsene Wenger says Fifa's U-turn was
OL,4,C'absolutely necessary and beyond
OL,5,Cquestion'
OL,7,FClubs within the European Football
OL,8,FClubs (EFC) group are understood to
OL,9,Fhave contacted Fifa themselves,
OL,10,Fconcerned about the FFE plan, given it
OL,11,Fwas intended to cover Club World Cups
OL,12,Fand would have materially affected
OL,13,Fplans agreed between the EFC and Fifa
OL,14,Fto create a joint venture on Club
OL,15,FWorld Cup competition rights.
OL,17,FFifa currently has no agreement in
OL,18,Fplace with EFC for the staging of the
OL,19,F2029 Club World Cup.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G8/9
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
