PN,30909
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F309A1786191514
OL,3,CArsene Wenger says Fifa's U-turn was
OL,4,C'absolutely necessary and beyond
OL,5,Cquestion'
OL,7,FWenger's statement was certainly less
OL,8,Fexplosive than the one issued last
OL,9,FFriday by Fifa's chief operating
OL,10,Fofficer Kevin Lamour, who said in a
OL,11,Fstatement that staff at the global
OL,12,Fgoverning body had been "deceived" by
OL,13,FInfantino.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G9/9
